Overview
--------

This is a fast boolean formula and QBF calculator. It reads a boolean formula
and checks whether it is valid (tautology) or satisfiable (with '-s').
It also supports generating full truth tables ('-t') and structured JSON ('-j'),
along with a client-side WebAssembly developer playground with 14 languages.

Attribution & Original Credits
